// never felt mutual love, grew up from a poor family.
// Attended her aranged marriage but noticed her sworn lover never showed up, she ran away after being disappointed because she had started to like him but got jumped by bandits in her search for him.
// file: ghost_bride, speaker: Ghost Bride

// ============================================================
// CASUAL
// ============================================================

title: GhostBride_Casual_01
tags: casual
speaker: ghost_bride
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual01
Ghost Bride: [auto/] I keep smoothing the wrinkles out of this dress. Force of habit. It was supposed to be the most beautiful thing I ever wore.
//END: casual01
===

title: GhostBride_Casual_02
tags: casual
speaker: ghost_bride
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual02
Ghost Bride: [auto/] You know, waiting for people to place their bets feels like waiting at the altar. A lot to worry about.
//END: casual02
===

title: GhostBride_Casual_03
tags: casual
speaker: ghost_bride
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual03
Ghost Bride: [auto/] My mother used to say love finds you when you stop looking. I've stopped, where is it now?
//END: casual03
===

title: GhostBride_Casual_04
tags: casual
speaker: ghost_bride
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual04
Ghost Bride: [auto/] There is something about shuffling cards that reminds me of how quickly fate can shift something.
//END: casual04
===

title: GhostBride_Casual_05
tags: casual
speaker: ghost_bride
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual05
Ghost Bride: [auto/] I ran out into the dark for him. The road was so cold. This table is warmer, at least.
//END: casual05
===

title: GhostBride_Casual_06
tags: casual
speaker: ghost_bride
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual06
Ghost Bride: [auto/] Sometimes I catch my reflection and I think... I look exactly the same as that night. Funny how death preserves you at your worst moment.
//END: casual06
===

title: GhostBride_Casual_07
tags: casual
speaker: ghost_bride
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual07
Ghost Bride: [auto/] I am betrothing these chips to this hand. If it betrays me, well, it would not be the first time.
//END: casual07
===

title: GhostBride_Casual_08
tags: casual
speaker: ghost_bride
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual08
Ghost Bride: [auto/] My gut has led me astray before, I don't know if I can trust it.
//END: casual08
===

title: GhostBride_Casual_09
tags: casual
speaker: ghost_bride
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual09
Ghost Bride: [auto/] Committing to a bad hand is just like committing to a bad marriage. You keep paying and paying until there is nothing left.
//END: casual09
===

title: GhostBride_Casual_10
tags: casual
speaker: ghost_bride
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual10
Ghost Bride: [auto/] I do not calculate odds. I feel them. Right here, in the chest where my heart used to beat.
//END: casual10
===

title: GhostBride_Casual_11
tags: casual
speaker: ghost_bride
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual11
Ghost Bride: [auto/] People overthink this game. Sometimes you just have to throw the veil over your eyes and leap.
//END: casual11
===

title: GhostBride_Casual_12
tags: casual
speaker: ghost_bride
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual12
Ghost Bride: [auto/] I wonder what love feels like...
//END: casual12
===

title: GhostBride_Casual_13
tags: casual
speaker: ghost_bride
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual13
Ghost Bride: [auto/] My father arranged the marriage, I hated the thought until I met the groom. I was naive to think it was mutual.
//END: casual13
===

title: GhostBride_Casual_14
tags: casual
speaker: ghost_bride
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual14
Ghost Bride: [auto/] He never came. The ceremony began and his seat was empty. I kept looking at the door. Every footstep... none of them were his.
//END: casual14
===

title: GhostBride_Casual_15
tags: casual
speaker: ghost_bride
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual15
Ghost Bride: [auto/] I ran from the altar in this dress. Right out into the night, down roads I did not know. The bandits found me before he did. He never found me at all.
//END: casual15
===

title: GhostBride_Casual_16
tags: casual
speaker: ghost_bride
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual16
Ghost Bride: [auto/] This dress was supposed to mean the start of something. Now it is just what I was wearing when everything ended. I cannot take it off. Believe me, I have tried.
//END: casual16
===

